Thought: First, I need to generate a dataset of sulphides polymorphs. I'll start by getting bulk polymorph data for various sulphide compositions and save them to a directory.
Action: batch_retrieve_polymorphs
Action Input: {"compositions": ["FeS", "CoS", "NiS", "CuS", "ZnS", "MnS", "CdS", "PbS", "Ag2S", "SnS", "SnS2", "MoS2", "WS2", "TiS2", "VS2"], "max_energy_above_hull": 0.3, "max_per_composition": 3, "save_directory": "sulphide_polymorphs"}

Thought: Now that I have the polymorph data for all compositions, I need to consolidate them into a single dataset for training. Then I'll prepare the tabular dataset with advanced feature engineering and split it into train/test sets.
Action: consolidate_polymorph_datasets
Action Input: {"composition_files": {"FeS": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/FeS_polymorphs.json", "CoS": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/CoS_polymorphs.json", "NiS": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/NiS_polymorphs.json", "CuS": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/CuS_polymorphs.json", "ZnS": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/ZnS_polymorphs.json", "MnS": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/MnS_polymorphs.json", "CdS": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/CdS_polymorphs.json", "PbS": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/PbS_polymorphs.json", "Ag2S": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/Ag2S_polymorphs.json", "SnS": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/SnS_polymorphs.json", "SnS2": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/SnS2_polymorphs.json", "MoS2": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/MoS2_polymorphs.json", "WS2": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/WS2_polymorphs.json", "TiS2": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/TiS2_polymorphs.json", "VS2": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphide_polymorphs/VS2_polymorphs.json"}, "output_path": "consolidated_sulphides.json"}

Thought: Now I'll prepare the tabular dataset with advanced feature engineering, normalize the features, and split it into train/test sets with the specified parameters.
Action: prepare_tabular_dataset
Action Input: {"polymorphs_json_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/consolidated_sulphides.json", "output_path": "sulphides_dataset", "target_property": "formation_energy_per_atom", "feature_engineering": "advanced", "test_split": 0.2, "normalize": true}

Thought: Now I'll train the XGBoost model with the specified hyperparameters using the prepared dataset.
Action: train_xgboost_model
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphides_dataset/train.csv", "test_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphides_dataset/test.csv", "model_save_path": "xgboost_model.json", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}

Thought: Now I'll evaluate the model on the test set with detailed analysis and perform cross-validation to get comprehensive performance metrics.
Action: evaluate_xgboost_model
Action Input: {"model_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/xgboost_model.json", "test_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphides_dataset/test.csv", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "detailed_analysis": true}

Thought: Let me perform cross-validation to get additional performance metrics, since the detailed evaluation encountered an error.
Action: perform_cross_validation
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_3/sulphides_dataset/train.csv", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "cv_folds": 5, "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}
